	&lt;div&gt;The Constitution provides for &lt;strong&gt;an independent election commission &lt;/strong&gt;to ensure &lt;strong&gt;free and fair election &lt;/strong&gt;to the Parliament, the State legislature,and the offices of President and Vice-President.&lt;/div&gt;
