&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Radio waves are used in many diagnostic procedures because of their high penetrance.&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Radiograms are then studied by the doctors to identify the various abnormalities in the patient&amp;#39;s body organs.&lt;/li&gt;
