	&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;&quot;&gt;Muscular &amp;rarr; serosa + mucosa &amp;rarr; submucosa: This sequence is incorrect and nonsensical because it does not follow the correct anatomical order and incorrectly combines layers.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;&quot;&gt;Serosa &amp;rarr; muscular &amp;rarr; submucosa &amp;rarr; mucosa: This sequence is the reverse of the correct order, placing the outermost layer first and the innermost layer last.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

