&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;&quot;&gt;Rationale: Clomipramine, a tricyclic antidepressant (TCA), is also effective in treating OCD and has been historically used for this purpose. However, due to its side effect profile, it is often considered when SSRIs, like fluoxetine, are not effective or not tolerated.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;&quot;&gt;Carbamazepine&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

