	&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;&quot;&gt;Rationale: Carbamazepine is an anticonvulsant and mood stabilizer used for seizure disorders and bipolar disorder, not typically indicated for OCD.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;&quot;&gt;Chlorpromazine&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;ul&gt;
