&lt;/ul&gt;

&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Conclusion&lt;/strong&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;&quot;&gt;Fluoxetine, an SSRI, is widely used and considered a first-line treatment for Obsessive-Compulsive Disorder due to its efficacy and tolerability. While clomipramine is also effective, SSRIs like fluoxetine are preferred due to their more favorable side effect profiles.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

