&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Calculation:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;We need to consider the digit 7 appearing in the units place and the tens place.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Occurrences in the units place:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;The numbers where 7 appears in the units place are: 7, 17, 27, 37, 47, 57, 67, 77, 87, 97.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;There are 10 such numbers.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Occurrences in the tens place:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;The numbers where 7 appears in the tens place are: 70, 71, 72, 73, 74, 75, 76, 77, 78, 79.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;There are 10 such numbers.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Notice that the number 77 has the digit 7 in both the units and the tens place. We have counted it once in the units place list and once in the tens place list.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Total number of times the digit 7 appears = (Occurrences in units place) + (Occurrences in tens place)&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Total = 10 + 10 = 20&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;there4; The number 7 will be written 20 times when writing down all the numbers from 1 to 100.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;The Correct Answer is&amp;nbsp;&lt;u&gt;&lt;strong&gt;15&amp;ndash;30 km&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/u&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;display: flex;gap: 6px;align-items: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;img height=&quot;26px&quot; src=&quot;//cdn.testbook.com/resources/lms_creative_elements/in_news.png&quot; width=&quot;26px&quot; /&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;vertical-align: middle;font-size: 21px;&quot;&gt;&lt;u&gt;In News&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Russia has deployed fibre optic first-person-view (FPV) drones in Ukraine since spring 2024.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;display: flex;gap: 6px;align-items: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;img height=&quot;26px&quot; src=&quot;//cdn.testbook.com/resources/lms_creative_elements/key-point-image.png&quot; width=&quot;26px&quot; /&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;vertical-align: middle;font-size: 21px;&quot;&gt;&lt;u&gt;Key Points&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li data-end=&quot;212&quot; data-start=&quot;120&quot;&gt;
	&lt;p data-end=&quot;212&quot; data-start=&quot;122&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-end=&quot;132&quot; data-start=&quot;122&quot;&gt;Russia&lt;/strong&gt; has deployed &lt;strong data-end=&quot;172&quot; data-start=&quot;146&quot;&gt;fibre optic FPV drones&lt;/strong&gt; in &lt;strong data-end=&quot;187&quot; data-start=&quot;176&quot;&gt;Ukraine&lt;/strong&gt; since &lt;strong data-end=&quot;209&quot; data-start=&quot;194&quot;&gt;spring 2024&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
	&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li data-end=&quot;331&quot; data-start=&quot;213&quot;&gt;
	&lt;p data-end=&quot;331&quot; data-start=&quot;215&quot;&gt;These drones are similar to regular &lt;strong data-end=&quot;259&quot; data-start=&quot;251&quot;&gt;UAVs&lt;/strong&gt; but use &lt;strong data-end=&quot;301&quot; data-start=&quot;268&quot;&gt;ultra-thin glass fibre cables&lt;/strong&gt; instead of &lt;strong data-end=&quot;328&quot; data-start=&quot;313&quot;&gt;radio waves&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
	&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li data-end=&quot;412&quot; data-start=&quot;332&quot;&gt;
	&lt;p data-end=&quot;412&quot; data-start=&quot;334&quot;&gt;The fibre optic connection makes them &lt;strong data-end=&quot;409&quot; data-start=&quot;372&quot;&gt;immune to jamming or interception&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
	&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li data-end=&quot;476&quot; data-start=&quot;413&quot;&gt;
	&lt;p data-end=&quot;476&quot; data-start=&quot;415&quot;&gt;They allow &lt;strong data-end=&quot;436&quot; data-start=&quot;426&quot;&gt;secure&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong data-end=&quot;473&quot; data-start=&quot;438&quot;&gt;high-quality video transmission&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
	&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li data-end=&quot;554&quot; data-start=&quot;477&quot;&gt;
	&lt;p data-end=&quot;554&quot; data-start=&quot;479&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-end=&quot;500&quot; data-start=&quot;479&quot;&gt;Operational range&lt;/strong&gt; is between &lt;strong data-end=&quot;527&quot; data-start=&quot;512&quot;&gt;15 to 30 km&lt;/strong&gt;, based on the tech used.&lt;/p&gt;
	&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li data-end=&quot;695&quot; data-start=&quot;555&quot;&gt;
	&lt;p data-end=&quot;695&quot; data-start=&quot;557&quot;&gt;They provide &lt;strong data-end=&quot;593&quot; data-start=&quot;570&quot;&gt;longer battery life&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong data-end=&quot;615&quot; data-start=&quot;595&quot;&gt;greater accuracy&lt;/strong&gt;, and &lt;strong data-end=&quot;639&quot; data-start=&quot;621&quot;&gt;dependable use&lt;/strong&gt; in &lt;strong data-end=&quot;652&quot; data-start=&quot;643&quot;&gt;urban&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong data-end=&quot;666&quot; data-start=&quot;654&quot;&gt;forested&lt;/strong&gt;, or &lt;strong data-end=&quot;694&quot; data-start=&quot;671&quot;&gt;indoor environments&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
	&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

